  "limitation": "Source fidelity, not hazard accuracy: serialized GeoJSON inverse-projected and compared to MuPDF rasterization of isolated path/clip commands obtained from the same PyMuPDF extraction. Independent of Shapely fill interpretation, NOT independent of PyMuPDF extraction. Source interiors exclude a 2/3 PDF-point boundary band; MuPDF interiors exclude 2 raster pixels. Full-mask metrics supplement this blind band. Roundtrip gates: p99.9 vertex-to-boundary error <=0.1m and symmetric-difference area <=0.01%; maxima and outlier counts retained because tiny degenerate spikes can collapse. Shifted negative controls must fail the boundary gate. Narrow shapes can have no interior samples. Labels, strokes and blend styling omitted. No road control or survey validation."
